---
// Section divider — sits between the Especial Mães card and the persona list.
---

<section class="pt-8 pb-4 lg:pt-12 lg:pb-8 bg-maes-wine relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle gradient for depth -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/10 to-transparent opacity-50"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="maes-container relative z-10 reveal">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 lg:gap-6 text-center">
      <h2
        class="font-maes-sans font-black italic text-white text-3xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl uppercase tracking-tighter"
      >
        Que tipo de mãe <span class="block lg:inline text-[#f2bcbc]">você é?</span>
      </h2>
      <p
        class="font-maes-sans font-medium text-white text-lg lg:text-xl xl:text-3xl opacity-90 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
      >
        Qual delas mais te define? Isso pode te ajudar a decidir qual palestra
        escolher.
      </p>

      <!-- Decorative element -->
      <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-[#f2bcbc]/30 rounded-full mt-2"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
